ZCL_COMMAND_READY_READ(
    "vault.intent.status", "vault.intent", "",
    "Read one transaction intent's chain-aware state",
    "Returns planned, proving, mempool_accepted, confirmed, finalized, reorged, "
    "conflicted, expired or failed plus txid when one exists. For asynchronous "
    "submission the operation_id is the same durable plan_id, so this remains "
    "the only status authority. Terminal failures carry a stable error_code; "
    "agents branch on it rather than log prose. Codes distinguish "
    "SHIELDED_REQUIREMENTS_MISSING, PREPARED_NOTE_MISMATCH or conflict, "
    "invalid proof/script, missing inputs, fee policy, locktime, expiry, and "
    "internal admission failure. After restart, a mempool_accepted intent "
    "revalidates and re-relays only its exact durable bytes when absent from "
    "the new process mempool.", ZCL_COMMAND_LIST_BUDGET,
    "vault,intent,status,txid,reorg", "zcl.vault_intent_status.input.v1",
